#!/bin/sh
# LING OS initramfs 收尾标记（init-bottom，live-boot 已挂载根之后）
PREREQ=""
prereqs() { echo "$PREREQ"; }
case "$1" in
    prereqs) prereqs; exit 0 ;;
esac
msg="LINGOS-INITRAMFS-BOTTOM root=$(cat /proc/cmdline 2>/dev/null)"
printf '<6>%s\n' "$msg" > /dev/kmsg 2>/dev/null || true
for c in /dev/ttyAMA0 /dev/ttyS0; do
    [ -e "$c" ] && printf 'LINGOS-INITRAMFS-BOTTOM\n' > "$c" 2>/dev/null || true
done
exit 0
